WEBVTT

NOTE Learner's voice lines are AI-generated speech; CAPCOM speaks with the computer's built-in voice. App footage and NASA media are real.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.600
[Learner's voice lines are AI-generated speech; CAPCOM speaks with the computer's built-in voice. App footage and NASA media are real.]

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:20.746
You (AI voice): Sea of Tranquility.

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:25.900
Capcom: Copy. The Sea of Tranquility, July 1969.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:32.187
You (AI voice): The Sun.

00:00:32.226 --> 00:00:33.626
Capcom: Right. The Moon hid the Sun.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.160
Artemis Ii Crew: ...like a fog around the Moon,

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:41.760
Artemis Ii Crew: and there are streamers of fog. There it goes again.

00:00:43.366 --> 00:00:45.315
You (AI voice): Both at once.

00:00:45.273 --> 00:00:48.627
Capcom: Good guess! Let's see what Apollo 15 found.

00:00:49.983 --> 00:00:52.883
Apollo 15: ...and hopefully they'll hit the ground at the same time.

00:00:54.623 --> 00:00:56.803
Apollo 15: How about that!

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:01.944
You (AI voice): Show me where Apollo 11 landed.

00:01:02.734 --> 00:01:05.550
Guide: Bottom half still sitting at Tranquility Base.

00:01:05.503 --> 00:01:09.492
Guide: I'm Eagle, the bottom half of the Apollo 11 Moon lander.

00:01:09.450 --> 00:01:11.650
Gesture: Make a fist and lean it: the Moon turns.

00:01:11.950 --> 00:01:12.564
Gesture: Point and hold: pick a place.

00:01:12.714 --> 00:01:17.594
Guide: At the south pole, some crater floors never get sunlight, so ice may be hiding there.

00:01:17.546 --> 00:01:20.686
Guide: Artemis astronauts plan to land in this region.

00:01:22.956 --> 00:01:24.700
Capcom: Sun means power. Earth means radio.

00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:27.300
Capcom: Ice map. Blue never sees the Sun.

00:01:28.650 --> 00:01:31.363
Capcom: Outpost Luna is online at Shackleton Crater Rim.

00:01:34.714 --> 00:01:36.729
You (AI voice): Into the shelter!

00:01:37.132 --> 00:01:39.982
Capcom: Copy. Everyone into the shelter.

00:01:45.583 --> 00:01:48.896
Capcom: Two real solar storms hit. Your crew stayed safe.
